{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104114631577-1104_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261104121708\"/><p>美國總統特朗普。</p><p>美國共和黨的中期選舉選情告急，總統特朗普當地周二（3日）深夜在旗下社交平台Truth Social發文，寫道：「我不在選票上，如果我參加了，我們（共和黨）就會以壓倒性的優勢獲勝！」 特朗普接受美媒訪問時表示，願意接受選舉結果，將與民主黨合作。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:25:12.146963+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T03:46:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:52.572057+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:52.572057+00:00","content_hash":"8f580ca4f2b9a0f0fe84db3406b97bf271b834dfe6fa71d17cb5b324ffe410aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}